<section class="section" aria-labelledby="starter-faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="starter-faq">Starter questions</h2></div>
    <div class="faq"><details><summary>What do you need from me?</summary><div><p>Your business name, the services you offer and the cities you serve. If you already have a logo, send it over and we'll use it; if you don't, we design one as part of the package. Photos of your work help a lot; phone photos are fine. If you have Google reviews, we pull those in too.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it a cookie-cutter site?</summary><div><p>It starts from a layout we've tested for your trade, so the structure, calls to action and page flow are already proven. The words, photos, services, reviews and service area are all yours, written for how your customers search.</p></div></details><details><summary>What's included for $499?</summary><div><p>Up to 5 pages, mobile-responsive design, copy written for your services and city, a contact form, click-to-call, basic on-page and technical SEO, logo design if you need one, help getting your business set up online, and unlimited revisions. It's a one-time fee, paid in full after you approve your preview — no payment before that.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is hosting included?</summary><div><p>Hosting is a separate, optional $79/month plan that covers hosting, SSL, security monitoring, updates, backups and up to 30 minutes of edits a month. Or we hand you the files at launch and you host it yourself.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I upgrade to Growth later?</summary><div><p>Yes. Upgrade within 90 days of launch and you only pay the difference between Starter and Growth.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do I own it?</summary><div><p>Yes. Once paid, your domain, content, photos and site files are yours.</p></div></details></div>
